{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">早前久未於鏡頭前下廚的黃淑儀再次大顯廚藝，在節目《流行都市》中教煮「鮮菇涼瓜鹹酸菜」。只要事前把所有配料準備妥當，甚至能在五分鐘之內快速煮好一道美味佳餚。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ffbe44ee-0c69-4b45-947a-aed8a72ee2be.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20264pRuibE23e1788491899.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ffbe44ee-0c69-4b45-947a-aed8a72ee2be.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鮮菇涼瓜鹹酸菜｜食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涼瓜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鮮菇（鮮冬菇）</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鹹酸菜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">薑</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">湯</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">油</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鹽</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">素蠔油</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">糖</p></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0c1c80ee-5a2d-4c30-9e00-d5c2a0a56b5b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20267sNlluqdkB1788491899.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0c1c80ee-5a2d-4c30-9e00-d5c2a0a56b5b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鮮菇涼瓜鹹酸菜｜做法</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">將鮮菇與鹹酸菜一同放入鑊中翻炒。</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">加入素蠔油與糖進行調味即告完成。</p></li></ol><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5d29cd23-7bc7-4f59-b694-bc055d2ea435.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ZFwmZIlG8r1788491900.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5d29cd23-7bc7-4f59-b694-bc055d2ea435.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鮮菇涼瓜鹹酸菜｜實用小貼士</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T01:43:53.737063+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}